{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 585279, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 117544, "uid": 81618, "type": 15, "title": "【工具】图片一键加框框", "tag": "", "created_at": 1678005697, "updated_at": 1678012860, "updated_uid": 81618, "comment_at": 1678005697, "last_at": 1680915771, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "在Wiki网站维护词条时经常需要用到带框图标，此工具可以给图片加框，方便快捷。界面展示使用方法先选择输出图标的分辨率（目前支持128*128或256*256），再选择或拖入素材图片（最好接近正方形，不", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 5, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 6176, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "江苏省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 585279, "content": "<div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div>在Wiki网站维护词条时经常需要用到带框图标，此工具可以给图片加框，方便快捷。</div><div></div></span></span><div><br></div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\">界面展示</p></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"528\" data-height=\"386\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_528/h_386/1069/81618/2023/2/5/806992.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_528/h_386/1069/81618/2023/2/5/806992.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div></div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\">使用方法</p></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 先选择输出图标的分辨率（目前支持128*128或256*256），再选择或拖入素材图片（<span style=\"\">最好接近正方形，不然会拉伸</span><span style=\"\">），然后点击相应按钮来预览加框后的效果（目前不支持微调），框框名字后面标注了框框的分辨率，框框的分辨率最好不要低于<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">输出图标的分辨率，不然框框可能会模糊。最后点击保存按钮即可在原图目录下找到加上了框框的图片。</span></span></div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 工具<span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">内置了五色天子、玩偶等十五款框框。加自己的框框也可以，框框要求有透明的部分，还要提供一个</span></span>像这样<img data-width=\"256\" data-height=\"256\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_256/h_256/1069/81618/2023/2/5/477964.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_256/h_256/1069/81618/2023/2/5/477964.png\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\">的蒙版，中间是#FFFF00FF（ARGB），四周是白色。工具会先按照蒙版抠图，然后再叠上框框，所以蒙版要和框框匹配。</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 其它的自己看吧。</div><div><br></div><div></div></span></span><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\">下载地址</p></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">链接:</span><a class=\"a-auto-links\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1AxrsZWKN8DmL5puZJ3763w\" style=\"\">https://pan.baidu.com/s/1AxrsZWKN8DmL5puZJ3763w</a><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">，提取码:2s27。</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"></span><br></div><div><br></div><div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "个性签名", "follow_num": 33, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "锟斤拷烫烫烫", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 97889183, "content_num": 37, "read_num": 250944, "